Idea for possible refactoring (separately from this change): pass ref to the associated union case instead of the entire union.

```cs
       private static unsafe int HandleEventNewStream(State state, ref PEER_STREAM_STARTED event)
        {
            var streamHandle = new SafeMsQuicStreamHandle(event.Stream);
            if (!state.TryQueueNewStream(streamHandle, event.Flags))
            {
                // This will call StreamCloseDelegate and free the stream.
                // We will return Success to the MsQuic to prevent double free.
                streamHandle.Dispose();
            }

            return QUIC_STATUS_SUCCESS;
